<section class="retreat-hero">
  <p class="retreat-hero__eyebrow">October 16–18, 2026 · Woodlands Retreat · Nunnelly, Tennessee</p>
  <h1>The First Christian Transhumanist Retreat</h1>
  <p class="retreat-hero__sub">Three days on 300 wooded acres — a lake, trails, a chapel, fire and conversation late into the night. Fewer talks, more table.</p>
  <div class="retreat-hero__cta">
