<section class="retreat-section retreat-intro">
  <div class="retreat-section__inner">
    <p>For ten years we've gathered online and on conference stages to ask one question together: what does it mean to follow Christ into the future? In October 2026, for the first time, we took that question into the woods. A retreat, not a conference — less presenting, more presence.</p>
    <p>About two dozen of us spent a weekend at Woodlands Retreat in Tennessee: talks from across the community, songs on Friday night, meals around shared tables, and conversation by the fire late into the night. The talks ran long because people kept talking back, which was the point.</p>
    <p class="retreat-theme-line">The theme that held our weekend: <strong>The Future and the Face of Christ.</strong></p>
  </div>
</section>

