<section class="retreat-section retreat-themes">
  <div class="retreat-section__inner">
    <h2>What we came to talk about</h2>
    <div class="retreat-theme">
      <h3>A pro-human technological future</h3>
      <p>The five supers — super-longevity, super-intelligence, super-embodiment, super-abundance, super-ecology — and how we work for the best possible future now. Steering between the AI apocalypses: AI as a blessing and not a curse.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="retreat-theme">
      <h3>Christian theology in light of the radical future</h3>
      <p>Simulation, Creation, the Multiverse, the Singularity — and the radical imagination of Christian theology. The Bible in an age of exponential change: and a faith that isn't looking for the exit. CS Lewis, NT Wright, GK Chesterton, Teilhard de Chardin, Nikolai Fedorov, Francis Bacon, and the ancient fathers and mothers of the church.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="retreat-theme">
      <h3>Rising faith in a technological age</h3>
      <p>Christianity for Secular Rationalists: rationalism, empiricism, pragmatism, and the epistemology of the faith of the future. Transhumanism for Sunday school class (a transhumanism your grandmother can use). How to talk to your friends about the future.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

